Nothing has been teasing its upcoming AI device for a while now. Today, Swedish House Mafia member Sebastian Ingrosso posted another image of the device, giving us a better look at the hardware.

@nothing https://t.co/WgcWNI2dIc— Sebastian Ingrosso (@Ingrosso) November 19, 2026

In the image, the device is seen alongside Headphone (1) Pro, which gives us some idea of its size. The device looks to be of a similar size and shape to something like the Nothing Ear (3) case, and is placed on its side in the photo. You can see two hardware buttons, the large one being labelled 'Talk' and...
